       <xsd:documentation>addEventListener() method in the Salesforce Console Integration Toolkit. You can’t create keyboard shortcuts for actions performed outside of the console.Represents custom keyboard shortcuts assigned to a Salesforce console app in Salesforce Classic. Before you can create custom shortcuts, a developer must define the shortcut’s action with the In API version 42.0, this field was renamed from customShortcut to customShortcuts.</xsd:documentation>
       <xsd:appinfo>Type: CustomShortcut[]</xsd:appinfo>
